  "title": "District Manager notice DCK-a36f6f84-fsr_road_closure_notice_december_storm_damage: 9 roads closed or restricted (Chipmunk Creek FSR, American FSR, Bench FSR, Chilliwack Lake FSR, Foley Creek FSR, Hunter Creek FSR, Jones Lake FSR, Sow)",
